  "description": "Dependency injection integration for the unofficial OpenCode .NET SDK, a typed client for the OpenCode 2.x server HTTP API (OpenCode 1.x servers are not supported): registers one singleton client and every sub-client from it. The package id is OpenCodeAI.Sdk.Extensions; the assembly and every namespace are OpenCode.Sdk.",
